Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mkfat32
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: reproducible FAT32 filesystem creator for disk image assembly
 Formats a pre-allocated image file as a FAT32 filesystem, optionally populated
 from a directory tree, producing byte-identical output across runs so an ESP
 can be assembled deterministically.
